				1107,
				3
			],
			"Message": "feat(Mountain): Implement debug adapter lifecycle RPC handlers\n\nIntroduce three new gRPC handlers in the CocoonService debug module to fulfill the Vine protocol contract for debugging support. Implement `RegisterDebugAdapter` to register debug types in ApplicationState and emit `sky://debug/register` events to activate the launch UI. Add `StartDebugging` to mint session IDs and broadcast `sky://debug/start` events with configuration details, and `StopDebugging` to emit `sky://debug/sessionEnd` notifications upon termination.\n\nThese handlers bridge the extension host (Cocoon) with the Sky frontend, enabling the full debug lifecycle: registration of debug adapters, session initiation with proper context, and graceful session teardown. This completes the IPC contract required for VS Code extension debugging support within the Land editor.",
			"SHA": "4fb2a4f6a0d727fc8c1de5f525b9e7d366f17562"
		},
